{"id":"wb-5-271","name":"定林寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"定林寺 (高平市)","text":"定林寺为中华人民共和国山西省高平市的一座佛寺，位于米山镇七佛山南部半山腰处。定林寺原名永德寺，因寺侧定林泉而得名。寺院坐北朝南，占地约8000平方米，中轴线上有山门（观音阁）、雷音殿、七佛殿，两侧有廊庑和偏院等建筑，其中雷音殿为元代遗构，余为明清建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%9A%E6%9E%97%E5%AF%BA_(%E9%AB%98%E5%B9%B3%E5%B8%82)","revisionId":95182914,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95182914","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/dedf1169cba5c78d772ce616.jpg","title":"20260828_Dinglin_Temple_05.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260828_Dinglin_Temple_05.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9c/20260828_Dinglin_Temple_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 山西高平 定林寺","width":320,"height":213}}